      "category": "other",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "location_description"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Clinton Lake, one of Illinois' largest, covers about 5,000 acres and offers camping, fishing, boating, and swimming within its boundaries.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        19,
        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.dewittcountyil.gov/",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "DeWitt County is easily reached via two major interstates, I‑72 and I‑74, and three state routes, making travel convenient for residents.",
